SUMMARY:MOS — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: THE MOSAIC CO (MOS)\nRoadshow: www.netroadshow.com | Entry Code: M
 OS2026 | Direct Link: www.netroadshow.com/nrs/home/#!/?show=c614f800\n\nDe
 al context:\nThe Mosaic Company (MOS)\, rated Baa2/BBB/BBB (Moody's/S&P/Fi
 tch)\, has mandated BofA Securities\, Citigroup\, J.P. Morgan\, and Wells 
 Fargo Securities to arrange fixed income investor calls on August 7\, 2026
 \, ahead of a potential USD-denominated\, SEC-registered senior unsecured 
 transaction. The deal is at the Mandate stage with no size\, tenor\, or pr
 icing terms disclosed\, subject to market conditions following the investo
 r call series. BofA Securities is coordinating logistics for the two sched
 uled calls (11:00 AM and 1:00 PM)\, with CFO Luciano Siani Pires and VP/Tr
 easurer Paul Massoud representing the company.
